# Backend (NestJS)

`backend/` owns the NestJS API and control plane.

## Responsibilities

- Auth, sessions, authorization
- PostgreSQL persistence
- Business rules and orchestration
- Agent enrollment validation and ingestion
- APIs for `admin-panel/` and `client/`

## Trust boundaries

- Agents connect outbound HTTPS to NestJS only.
- UIs never talk to agents or VPS hosts.
- Do not invent final routes, DTOs, auth providers, or event names without a
  specification — mark unknowns explicitly.

